    "description": "Up for auction is a diverse collection of eight vintage and modern timepieces, featured by fine 14K solid gold pieces, classic mechanical automatics, and stylish everyday wristwatches.\n- Watches are in good used condition. All of the hands move on the watches when setting time. None of the watches are currently working.\n- Bulova 23 Vintage Watch: 14K gold case marked \"Bulova 14K Gold M2\" (Serial #Y39353). Features a chain closure and a gold-filled mesh wristband marked \"1/2010K KREISLER\" (band requires repair as one link has pulled away).\n- Benrus 21 Jewel Vintage Watch: 14K gold case marked \"BENRUS 14K Gold\" (Serial #780813). Fitted with a comfortable Speidel flexible expansion wristband. Does show some aged patina on the face of the watch.\n- Timex Viscount / Automatic Watch Head: Vintage oversized gold-tone watch head measuring approximately 1 3/4\" in diameter (no band included). Dial reads \"Water Resistant Automatic\" with date window. Case back marked \"Self Wind, Dust Resistant, Base Metal Bezel, Stainless Steel Back\".\n- Caravelle Vintage Ladies Watch: Marked \"M2\" with base metal bezel and stainless steel back. Paired with a gold-tone mesh band in good condition, complete with a safety chain and marked \"DUCHESS USA 10 GF TOP\".\n-Omni Quartz Watch: Classic quartz watch back marked \"Omni Quartz Limited, Hong Kong, Base Metal Bezel, Stainless Steel Back\" paired with a Speidel wristband.\n- Timex Expedition Indiglo: Outdoor sports watch featuring WR 50M water resistance, Indiglo night-light function, and original fabric/leather hybrid strap. Case back marked \"Timex Water Resistant\".\n-Chunky Chain-Link ID Bracelet Watch: Bold statement watch integrated into a thick link bracelet with fold-over closure. Shows cosmetic wear; missing side setting button/stem (sold as-is for parts/repair).\n- GG Quartz Turquoise & Rhinestone Watch: Fashion wristwatch featuring a rhinestone-accented bezel, Japanese movement, base metal bezel with stainless steel back, and a vibrant turquoise leather strap.\n***Estimated Secondary Market Values\n- Bulova 23 (14K Gold Case): $120 - $180 (Value primarily driven by 14K gold melt weight plus vintage brand appeal; account for broken band)\n-Benrus 21 Jewel (14K Gold Case): $110 - $160 (Value primarily driven by 14K gold melt weight)\n-Timex Automatic Watch Head: $30 - $50 (Popular vintage self-winding automatic series, missing band)\n-Caravelle Vintage Mesh Watch: $15 - $25 (Includes 10K gold-filled top Duchess bracelet)\n-Timex Expedition Indiglo: $15 - $25 (Reliable everyday functional piece)\n- Omni Quartz (Speidel Band): $10 - $15\n-GG Quartz Turquoise Rhinestone Watch: $8 - $15\n- Chunky Chain-Link ID Bracelet Watch: $5 - $10 (Condition issues / missing stem)\n***Total Estimated Lot Value: $313 - $480\n-Items Show Wear & Tear Consistent With Age - Items Are Sold As Is - Untested Unless Stated Otherwise- Manufacturers Are Not Verified or Authenticated - We Show What We Find As The Maker's Mark.",
